    "design_purpose": "materials_reward is the mid-run loot room payout (scaled by weakness reward multipliers); catalyst_item is the guaranteed shrine recovery; completion_unlock is the visible construction-vocabulary reward for the first boss kill. exit_after_stage lets the player bank recovered loot instead of facing the boss (push-or-bank decision). item_rewards (D-014) is the gear a cleared room drops by reward type: the loot room a keen piece, the shrine a wrought one, the Tyrant a tier-2 wrought piece; deeper is better, and death loses them like other run loot."
